EntMod_i386.so -- EntMod ("Ent Mod v4"), reconstructed from the shipped DLL, with HAVOC9 changes
=================================================================================================

What this is
------------

EntMod_i386.so is built from a clean, recompilable C++ reconstruction of the abandoned EntMod
("Ent Mod v4", Drunken_F00l / remortal, adminop.net), which shipped only as a binary with no source.
It was reverse-engineered from the shipped EntMod_MM.dll / EntMod_i386.so into EntMod4/src/EntMod4/
(the faithful original) and EntMod4/src/h9/ (the HAVOC9 additions). It is a Metamod-R plugin for The
Specialists on the H9XASH engine. This file is the Linux build; EntMod_MM.dll is the Windows build of
the same source.

Deployed file : addons/EntMod/dlls/EntMod_i386.so
Built by      : EntMod4/src/build-linux.sh (make -C EntMod4/src/EntMod4, g++ -m32)
                -> EntMod4/dist/EntMod_i386.so, deployed to H9XASH/ts/addons/EntMod/dlls and
                EntMod4/unix/addons/EntMod/dlls.
